SUMMARY:K-POP PARTY: AFTER PARTY
DESCRIPTION:THE ‘GUILTY’ AFTER-HOURS: SUNDAY K-POP NIGHT \nThe big stage went dark\, but the adrenaline hasn‘t stopped. Going straight home is downright ‘Criminal’.Giving in to the bass is your best ‘Guilty’ pleasure. Zero unwanted ‘Advice’. You already know what you ‘WANT’.From midnight hypnotic solo anthems to non-stop 2nd\, 3rd\, 4th & 5th Gen K-Pop bangers—we keep the room shaking until 4 AM! 💥‍\n\n [DISCOUNT IN 3 STEPS] (on instagram) FOLLOW @cheon_cheon_hi‍ SHARE this post to your STORY (Tag us) COMMENT your most ’Guilty‘ K-Pop obsession below! \n\n\n Date & Time: 29th of November (Sunday) | 22:00 – 4:00 Location: NarragansetKomuny Paryskiej 5A\, entrance from ul. Piotrkowska 110 through Pasaż SchilleraŁódż 90-519‍\n\nTickets: Online:· Early Bird: 30PLN· Second release: 40PLN· Third release: 50PLN At the Gate: 50PLN Bundles (3 tickets + 1 free):· Early Bird: 90 PLN for 4 tickets· Second release: 120 PLN for 4 tickets· Third release: 150 PLN for 4 tickets Please note: The number of online tickets is limited! Once one ticket release sells out\, the next more expensive release will automatically become available.Online ticket sale finishes when the party starts\n\n\nGiveaways: K-bridge vouchers Cheoncheonhi merchandise Lovely idol pins Lovely idol photo cards\nEntertainment: Random Play Dance at 1:30AM Best Dresser Contest: Take a photo anywhere in the club – the best photo will win amazing prizes! Lovely Idol Pins will be given to everyone who participates in the photo contest. You can post a photo till 2:30 AM. Winners can pick up their gift till 3:00 AM. Birthday: You can request a Birthday Song! We will sing it after Random Play Dance! Soju: You can purchase soju at the party. DJ: DJ Akina\n Event 16+!Minors (at the age of 16 and 17 years old) are asked to bring the parental consent.
